{title: 053 - All Praise to Thee}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #053 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 53}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]All [D]praise to [Em]thee, [G/B]my [C]God, [D]this [G]night,
[G/B]for [Am]all the [G]blessings [C/G]of [D7/F#]the [G]light!
[G/B]Keep [C]me, [D]O [G]keep me, [Am/C]King [D]of [G]kings,
[G/B]beneath [D]thine [Em]own [Bm]almighty [G]wings.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Forgive [D]me, [Em]Lord, [G/B]for [C]thy [D]dear [G]Son,
[G/B]the [Am]ill that [G]I this [C/G]day [D7/F#]have [G]done,
[G/B]that [C]with [D]the [G]world, myself, [D]and [G]thee,
[G/B]I, [C]ere [D]I [Em]sleep, [Bm]at [Am/C]peace [D]may [G]be.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]O [D]may my [Em]soul [G/B]on [C]thee [D]repose,
[G/B]and [Am]with sweet [G]sleep mine [C/G]eyelids [G]close,
[G/B]sleep that [C]may [D]me [G]more vigorous make
[G/B]to [C]serve [D]my [Em]God [Bm]when [Am/C]I [D]awake.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[G]Praise [D]God, from [Em]whom [G/B]all [C]blessings [G]flow;
[G/B]praise him, [Am]all creatures [C/G]here [D7/F#]below;
[G/B]praise him [C]above, [G]ye heavenly host;
[G/B]praise [C]Father, [Em]Son, [Bm]and [Am/C]Holy [G]Ghost.
{end_of_verse}
